WEBVTT

00:01:58.373 --> 00:02:00.176
In the 20th century,

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:06.428
improvements of life came
with tiny third parties and their allies

00:02:06.452 --> 00:02:09.480
pushing the major parties
in the electoral arena

00:02:09.504 --> 00:02:11.479
to adopt such measures,

00:02:12.325 --> 00:02:15.696
such as the right to form labor unions,

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.299
the 40-hour week,

00:02:17.323 --> 00:02:19.681
progressive taxation, the minimum wage,

00:02:19.705 --> 00:02:21.866
unemployment compensation

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:23.365
and social security.

00:02:23.865 --> 00:02:25.837
More recently came Medicare

00:02:25.861 --> 00:02:28.547
and civil rights, civil liberties,

00:02:28.571 --> 00:02:30.556
nuclear arms treaties,